<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>11/16 福岡四週年旅遊</name><Placemark><name>A · ONE FUKUOKA HOTEL</name><description>09:30 出發｜起點；建議 09:20–09:30 離開飯店。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4000978,33.5908005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>B · AMAM DACOTAN 六本松本店</name><description>10:00–10:45｜推薦計程車約 12–20 分；步行至天神南→七隈線六本松→步行，合計約 25–35 分。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.3814381,33.5780845,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>C · 大濠公園</name><description>10:45–12:15｜步行約 12–20 分、0.9–1.5 km，依公園入口。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.3764646,33.5862065,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D · 博多炉端 魚男 Fish Man</name><description>12:30–14:00｜推薦計程車約 10–20 分；步行估約 35–45 分，依湖畔出發點。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.3995851,33.5843858,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>E · ONE FUKUOKA HOTEL</name><description>14:30–17:45｜步行約 10–15 分、0.8–1.2 km。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4000978,33.5908005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>F · 博多もつ鍋 やま中 赤坂店</name><description>18:30–20:00｜步行約 15–20 分；計程車約 8–12 分＋候車。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.3908465,33.5875425,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>G · 福岡大名花園城市</name><description>20:00–20:40｜步行約 8–12 分、600–900 m。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.3950768,33.5895371,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>H · 福岡市役所西側廣場</name><description>20:40–21:30｜步行約 12–17 分、0.9–1.2 km。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4011491,33.5900083,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>I · 天神中央公園（選去）</name><description>21:30 後（選去）｜步行約 5–8 分、300–500 m。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4029541,33.5904126,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>J · ONE FUKUOKA HOTEL</name><description>散步後｜從中央公園步行約 8–12 分；各出入口不同。｜概略位置，請核對實際店址</description><Point><coordinates>130.4000978,33.5908005,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>